35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The data shows we need a place that allows solo time without isolation.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,I found that all-in rates mean the light eater pays for the big appetite.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,The island houses have one bathroom for everyone. That sounds very difficult for me.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The ferry schedule is tight. We lose two full days to travel and waiting.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The offshore houses are 5,400 yen a head a night, but food is extra. That is a surprise.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Minato, that is a serious issue. We need a place with more privacy.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
