42,2,2,talk,Minato,,I am worried about the cold water and the shared space. I need a private bath.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. The travel time is too high. We need a closer option.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"I see. The valley inns are 17,000 yen with meals. That is much higher.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,The city option allows us to split up and come back. That solves the crowding.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The city option has separate rooms. That is better for privacy and quiet.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"If we have a private room, I can sleep better. I do not like sharing a bath.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The city is closer. We can arrive in the morning and leave in the evening.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,"The city option is 12,000 to 20,000 yen for the bed. Meals are extra.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,I think the city option is the best balance. It allows group time and solo time.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I agree. The city option is more flexible and private. I prefer it.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,I am relieved. A private room and a private bath would help me sleep.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I support the city option. It minimizes travel time and allows quiet.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,I am concerned about the total cost. The city option is more expensive.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
